  "H5_source_derivation": [
    "Output test-state/result callbacks precede native callbacks (170-191). During the ordinary body script document.readyState is loading, so resolve_log returns at4335-4336; Result Pass reaches native capture via notify_result3908-3921.",
    "Default Tests.output is true, so expose_assert1502-1537 records optional assert-output data even with debug=false. Genuine output:false disables this tracking, not assertion execution. H5 has an internal assert record, but completion delivery fails before native capture sees its third argument; do not invent a captured assert payload.",
    "After accepted LoadComplete, Window environment load-zero timer93-100 calls complete. complete sets phase COMPLETE before notify_complete3927-3942; notify_complete sets internal status Ok then invokes callback array4037-4069.",
    "First completion callback is Output.show_results. resolve_log sees complete readyState, no #log, and calls missing createElementNS at4338 before native Completion callback. No callback-array try/catch exists (forEach4890-4897).",
    "Pinned Call.handle_not_callable creates native TypeError not a callable function; VM error propagation retains native error through handle_error/handle_throw. safe_error preserves native kind/message, and Boa timer failure adds Timer callback prefix before Window.error dispatch.",
    "Window.error handler5050-5083 changes private harness status to Error and calls done/end_wait. complete immediately returns because phase is already COMPLETE, so no retry/native Completion. The original real file timeout later also calls complete and returns; observer remains Waiting, execution_failed sticky true, no observer fault.",
    "Do not report an observed harness Error: no typed Completion exists. Keep the one healthy Result historical prefix plus actual native failure and parent MissingCompletion. LoadComplete/initial_failure false is already frozen before this later output error."
  ],
